The JSON file(s) in this directory — val_answer.json (and, optionally,
test_answer.json) — are the PhysBench benchmark's publicly released
ground-truth answer files, sourced from:

    https://github.com/USC-GVL/PhysBench

Upstream licence: Apache License 2.0, Copyright (c) PhysBench authors.
See the upstream LICENSE at:

    https://github.com/USC-GVL/PhysBench/blob/main/LICENSE

The data is reproduced here unmodified for the sole purpose of enabling
local accuracy scoring as permitted by the upstream licence. This directory
contains answer data; vendored evaluator source and its licence are in
../official_eval/.

Citation:

    @article{chow2025physbench,
      title={PhysBench: Benchmarking and Enhancing Vision-Language Models
             for Physical World Understanding},
      author={Chow, Wei and Mao, Jiageng and Li, Boyi and
              Seita, Daniel and Guizilini, Vitor and Wang, Yue},
      journal={arXiv preprint arXiv:2501.16411},
      year={2025}
    }
